("BRU","CLC","near","Bruton Dovecote",L,51.10806,-2.45306,150,"Your train passes near the Bruton Dovecote, on the train's {side}, a stone tower built between the 15th and 17th centuries that may have been a lookout before it housed pigeons.","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bruton_Dovecote",X),
