("DWL","TGM","near","Parson and Clerk",L,50.56366,-3.47089,0,"As your train goes through Parson's Tunnel, the two rock stacks it is named after, the Parson and Clerk, stand just off the headland on the train's {side}.","https://www.southwestcoastpath.org.uk/walksdb/592/",X),
